s, `/loop`, Web pa"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"nel |\n| `mock` | official | server · web | Deterministic mock model turns: `/mock run` / `replay` (u"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"nstable) |\n| `sessions` | official | server | Multi-session orchestration: `session_status/create/se"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"nd` tools |\n| `coding-plan` | official | server | Reuse `codex login` / `grok login` subscriptions a"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"s providers |\n| `preset-builder` | official | web | Preset details page in dsh Web Settings |\n| `wor"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"kbench-ui` | official | web | The Web workbench frame other panels dock into |\n| `sidechat` | offici"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"al | server · web | Side-chat panel on the Web workbench (needs workbench-ui) |\n| `herdr-agent-state"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"` | official | server | Report pane agent state, session ref, and title/model/ctx metadata to Herdr'"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"s pane socket |\n| `terminal` | dsh | server | PTY terminal: `terminal_open/send/read/signal/close/li"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"st` |\n| `lsp` | dsh | server | Read-only `lsp` navigation tool |\n| `mcp` | dsh | server | MCP client"},{"id":"p14s12","text":": `mcp__server__tool` external tools |\n| `acp` | dsh | server | Agent Client Protocol server |\n| `co"},{"id":"p14s13","text":"de-runtime-ts` | dsh | server | `run_code` TypeScript worker-thread runtime |\n| `code-runtime-py` | "},{"id":"p14s14","text":"dsh | server | `run_code` Python runtime |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"`server` plugins work in any frontend (tools render generically); `web` adds a\ndsh Web client module"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"; `tui` adds Mayfly-native UI. A plugin is useful in a\ngiven frontend if it has `server` **or** that"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" frontend's own contribution."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 📥 Submitting a plugin"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Published an npm package (or a GitHub repo with committed build output)?\nSubmit a listing:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"1. Read `registry/community/README.md`.\n2. Copy `registry/submission-template.json`\nto `registry/com"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"munity/<slug>.json` and open a PR.\n3. CI scratch-installs every declared source; a maintainer review"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"s against the\nreview checklist."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The manifest spec is `docs/market.md` — manifests are\n**discovery/install metadata only**; the runti"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"me contract is still your\npackage plus its `cordis.patch.yml`."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## 🛠️ Repository scripts"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"`dist/` is generated — changes land through the `index-publish` workflow's\nauto-merged PR, never by "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"/` is generated — changes land through the `index-publish` workflow's\nauto-merged PR, never by hand."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 🛠️ Plugin development"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Each plugin under `plugins/` is an independently installable package:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The source tree intentionally stays outside the DeepSeek Harness repository;\ndsh composes plugins th"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"rough profile-scoped installation and patch layers.\nSee AGENTS.md for the agent working rules and\ndo"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"cs/ for architecture notes and how-to guides."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## 📚 Documentation"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- Marketplace & manifest spec\n- Plugin docs — each plugin directory has its own README\n- Architectur"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"e & how-to guides\n- Mayfly · Mayfly website"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 🤝 Contributing"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Issues, ideas, and pull requests are welcome. Keep plugins focused, document\ntheir runtime contracts"},{"id":"p30s2","text":", and include tests for changes to tools, persistence,\nor UI behavior."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Released under the MIT License."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"l